<p>Prepare a defensive device that stores an electrical charge for 8 turns.</p><p>If your life falls below 0 while the AED is active it will activate to shock you back into life, negating the triggering attack, restoring <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">313, 422, 506, 577, 641</acronym> life and dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">197, 266, 318, 363, 403</acronym> lightning damage in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> that dazes affected enemies for 3 turns.</p><p>If the AED does not activate, the cooldown is reduced by 15 turns.</p><p>The healing and damage will increase with your Steampower.</p>